================================================================================
Python libbladeRF Bindings: Change Log Summary

For more detailed information, please see the git change log and issue tracker
hosted on GitHub: https://github.com/nuand/bladeRF
================================================================================

v1.5.0 (2026-07-28)
--------------------------------
 * keep CFFI declarations synchronized with the current libbladeRF header
 * expose packed SC16, feature control, trigger control, and gain calibration
 * expose rational rates, stream helpers, metadata, timestamps, and device modes
 * validate synchronous buffers using the public sample representation and
   total interleaved sample count
 * add Python API, header parity, packed RX, and deterministic RX X2 hardware
   regressions (#1068)
 * remove deprecated setup metadata and fail packaging checks on warnings
 * document Windows DLL dependency lookup failures (#989)
 * add public lifecycle and synchronous sample buffer helpers
 * provide actionable native library loading failures and override support
 * use one version source with PEP 517 build metadata
 * document the bladerf-tool RX and TX sample file format

v1.4.0 (2025-05-06)
--------------------------------
 * add support for SC16_Q11_META format
 * update Python binding definitions

v1.3.0 (2023-02-13)
--------------------------------
 * add special case for loading Windows DLL in Python bindings
 * update Python bindings definitions

v1.2.1 (2021-10-04)
--------------------------------
 * add bladeRF 2.0 micro xA5 support
 * fix get_gain_modes and get_*_range functions
 * fix Python binding compatibility issue on macOS

v1.2.0 (2019-07-31)
--------------------------------
 * add OTP functions
 * update FPGA flash type definitions

v1.1.2 (2020-12-23)
--------------------------------
 * update definitions for libbladeRF v2.4.0

v1.1.1 (2019-07-31)
--------------------------------
 * add OTP functions
 * update definitions for libbladeRF v2.2.1

v1.1.1 (2018-12-21)
--------------------------------
 * bladerf-tool: don't print gain mode on tx channels
 * update definitions for libbladeRF v2.2.0

v1.1.0 (2018-10-30)
--------------------------------
 * Fix rx_channel_count and tx_channel_count
 * Use new bladerf_get_serial_struct in the get_serial method
 * Update with latest API functions
 * Improve import_header.py script

v1.0.1 (2018-08-24)
--------------------------------

This version is intended for use with libbladeRF v2.0.1.

Changes:
 * host: libbladeRF: Rename clock select option

v1.0.0 (2018-08-13)
--------------------------------

This version is intended for use with libbladeRF v2.0.0.

Initial public release.
